---
layout: base.njk
title: The Gurukul Journal
description: End-to-end AI tutorials for creators and brand builders, with images, infographics, and video. By Deenu Khan.
---
<section class="blog-hero">
  <div class="blog-hero-inner">
    <span class="post-eyebrow">Tutorials &amp; Guides</span>
    <h1 class="blog-hero-title">The Gurukul <em>Journal</em></h1>
    <div class="clay-rule" aria-hidden="true"></div>
    <p class="blog-hero-lede">End-to-end AI tutorials for creators and brand builders. Real tools, real prompts, real workflows, all with images, infographics, and video.</p>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="blog-list">
  <div class="post-grid">
    {% for post in collections.posts %}
    <a class="post-card" href="{{ post.url | url }}">
      {% if post.data.cover %}
      <div class="post-card-thumb">
        <img src="{{ post.data.cover }}" alt="{{ post.data.title }}" loading="lazy" decoding="async">
      </div>
      {% endif %}
      <div class="post-card-body">
        {% if post.data.tag %}<span class="post-card-tag">{{ post.data.tag }}</span>{% endif %}
        <h2 class="post-card-title">{{ post.data.title }}</h2>
        <p class="post-card-desc">{{ post.data.description }}</p>
        <div class="post-card-meta">
          <time datetime="{{ post.date | isoDate }}">{{ post.date | readableDate }}</time>
        </div>
      </div>
    </a>
    {% endfor %}
  </div>
</section>
